    <title>Alberta Securities Commission | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Alberta Securities Commission | 7,749 followers on LinkedIn. The Alberta Securities Commission (ASC) is the regulatory agency responsible for administering the province&amp;#39;s securities laws. It is entrusted to foster a fair and efficient capital market in Alberta and to protect investors.  As a member of the Canadian Securities Administrators, the ASC works to improve, coordinate and harmonize the regulation of Canada&amp;#39;s capital markets.">

