    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">What will it take to build an innovation ecosystem that attracts capital, earns trust and helps companies scale?

On October 27, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/claire-brownell?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Claire Brownell</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/erichmond1?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Eric Richmond</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/louiselee1?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Louise Lee</a> and Mark Zelmer joins Dr. <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/ryanjclements?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ryan Clements</a> on the ASC Connect stage to discuss "Building a leading and trusted innovation ecosystem in Canada"

Register now and secure your seat at ASC Connect: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/e-fiCVhA?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/e-fiCVhA</a>

Your registration includes a breakfast buffet, a catered networking lunch, a cocktail reception, and a full day of discussion with the people shaping what comes next.</p>
