  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="feed-reshare-content__commentary">🤝 Partner Spotlight: Welcoming the <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/canadian-securities-administrators-csa---autorit-s-canadiennes-en-valeurs-mobili-res-acvm-?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Canadian Securities Administrators (CSA) - Autorités canadiennes en valeurs mobilières (ACVM)</a> (CSA) <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/alberta-securities-commission?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Alberta Securities Commission</a> to the <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/canadafintechsymposium?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Canada FinTech Symposium</a> 2026 — Alberta Edition!

We're honoured to welcome the Canadian Securities Administrators (CSA / ACVM) as an Exhibition &amp; Panel Partner for the Alberta Edition in Calgary. 🇨🇦

As the council of Canada's provincial and territorial securities regulators, the CSA plays a defining role in advancing investor protection and building fair, efficient, and innovative capital markets across the country. Their presence brings an invaluable regulatory perspective to the conversations shaping the future of Canadian fintech.

From open banking and digital assets to AI, payments modernization, and the next generation of capital markets — smart, forward-looking regulation is what turns bold ideas into trusted, scalable innovation. Having the CSA in the room means founders, institutions, and investors can engage directly with the people helping shape that framework.

We can't wait to welcome the CSA team to the exhibition floor and to the panel stage. 🚀
📍 BMO Centre, Calgary
 📅 October 7–8, 2026
🔗 Register now: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eKUfefJ7?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eKUfefJ7</a>

