  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Just announced: new speakers and early bird rate extended

On October 27, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/robert-johnston-3669567?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Robert Johnston</a>, Chris Seasons, and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/hugh-sanderson-83aa842?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Hugh Sanderson</a> join <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/deborah-yedlin-38552a4a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Deborah Yedlin</a> on the ASC Connect stage to dig into one question: what will it take for Canadas energy sector to seize this generational opportunity?

Ticket prices will increase after October 11, so register now to lock in at a lower rate: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/e7KbzYCC?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/e7KbzYCC</a>

Your registration includes a breakfast buffet, a catered networking lunch, a cocktail reception, and a full day of discussion with the people shaping what comes next.

We look forward to welcoming you to ASC Connect 2026.</p>
